  "purpose": "Rung 2 (P2), stage (ii): judge the stage-(i) reference, the BETSE-order emulator with compact harmonic faces at BETSE's dt / 100 (BETSE's constants, SIM chained), against plain BETSE p2-barrier-dense. Its difference from BETSE is the named, documented model difference 'stencil' (BETSE's point-sampled 2-delta central divergence against compact faces with Cells' harmonic coefficient, measured emulator vs emulator) plus BETSE's own INIT step error; the emulator with BETSE's stencil reproduces BETSE to roundoff (parity-rung2-4-20261109-01/emulator-01/p2b-check-comparison). Tooling stage: no Cells engine model runs.",
